xed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":213877,"global_rank":248522,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":38747},{"name":"lennox55555/HAHD","owner":"lennox55555","html_url":"https://github.com/lennox55555/HAHD","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213874,"global_rank":248528,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":38748},{"name":"chichizhang0510/MorseCodeConverter","owner":"chichizhang0510","html_url":"https://github.com/chichizhang0510/MorseCodeConverter","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A little machine which can convert a piece of text into Morse code, or decrypt a piece of Morse code into plain text.","topics":[],"score":213874,"global_rank":248532,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":38749},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":213871,"global_rank":248535,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":38750}]